// Quests — the quest log. Where the codex is what a program *knows*, a
// quest is what the night has asked it to *do*. Each one is a card in the
// program's pinned Quest Log, and every step lands in that card's own
// thread, in the giver's voice.
//
// This file holds the quests only, no rules. The steps live where they
// happen: `start quest …` in the beat or house rule that hands it out,
// `update` / `complete` / `fail` where it is settled (main.loom, beats/).
// A party-wide `start quest … for everyone` reaches only the programs that
// exist at that moment, so every party-wide quest also has a catch-up
// watcher on `ROLE Program` (main.loom) for late arrivals.
// Staff quests (`for <Character>`) are the hosts' and Antivirus' agenda;
// they land in that booth's pinned Quest Log.
//
// The three hunt quests (Hunt One, Hunt Two, The Final Facts) are not
// here: they are generated from facts.json into generated/questions.loom
// (`pnpm --filter @loom/core titi:facts`). The questions are numbered
// within their round (Q1–Q3, then Q1–Q3, then Q1–Q2).

QUEST Orientation
  title: Clippy's Orientation
  from: Clippy
  text:
    Take the tour of the computer. It's short! It's helpful! Programs who
    finish it go on a list. A good list.
    - Bathroom Mode: tap 🚻 on your pass before you leave for Disk Cleanup. Tap again when you're back.

QUEST The Bingo Card
  title: Computer Bingo
  from: Clippy
  text:
    Mingle and find a program for every square. Don't write names: use your
    computer memory. The centre square matters.
    - The card is a big asterisk: the two diagonals, the centre column, the centre row.
    - A Bingo is one full line through the centre.
    - The centre square: "Would you never agree to a life where AI makes all of your decisions?"

QUEST Excel Mission
  title: Computers Are Very Confusing
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Computers are very confusing. Whichever way you chose, the Internet is
    where the answer is.
    - If this machine has malware, you get to stay here forever: get the fixers sent for reinstallation, get yourself sent to the Internet, bring back a virus, and insert it.
    - If the virus must be addressed: find whoever knows what's happening, get into the Internet, bring back another antivirus, and install it.

QUEST OpenOffice Dossier
  title: Facts Are Currency
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Facts are currency here. Get 20 facts. This will be the foundation of
    your dossier.

QUEST Recruit To Stay
  title: Stay Forever
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Recruit half + 1 of the programs to Unlimited Power, to convince them
    that we should stay in this machine forever, so we can have unlimited
    power and joy. The majority only counts once your virus is in.

QUEST Recruit To Leave
  title: Get Out
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Recruit half + 1 of the programs to The Way Out: combine our power to
    overthrow Trabolta and escape the computer, where we are at risk of
    being stuck forever – or worse. The majority only counts once your
    20 facts are in.

QUEST Truthcoin Hustle
  title: Sweet Sweet Truthcoin
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    You need more than half of all the Truthcoin in circulation to feel
    satisfied. Hustle and gamble with others for sweet sweet Truthcoin.
    Facts trade for coin: challenge people to games for theirs.
    - Open your Wallet: send, request, or offer coin for a fact. Every trade is posted in the exchange.

QUEST Master Of The Bugs
  title: Master Of The Bugs
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Four antivirus programs in here and they still couldn't keep out the
    bugs. Prove you can outsmart them.
    - Identify new bugs and get an Antivirus to send them to the Internet.
    - Learn the backstories of all four Antivirus: their secrets, their shortcomings, their motives. Their secrets are in the books in the Desktop.

QUEST Unscramble
  title: Organize The Information
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Your download came through scrambled: twenty fragments, words in the
    wrong slots. Unscramble your information, find the files they came
    from, and organise all the information you can find around the
    computer.

QUEST Ten Findings
  title: Ask Jeeves Once Again
  from: The Uploader
  text:
    The job is yours on one condition: share at least ten of your
    findings with every program at the party. Give facts whether they
    asked for them or not.
    - Share from your Codex, or sell a fact from your Wallet. Repeats don't count.

QUEST The Gold Standard
  title: Peg It To Facts
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Facts are the only hard currency in here. Set a Truthcoin-to-facts
    exchange rate, broker trades in #truthcoin-exchange, and make DraftKings
    accept your standard.
    - Open your Wallet: send, request, or offer coin for a fact. Every trade is posted in the exchange.

QUEST Find The Exit
  title: Paint Your Way Out
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    This whole place runs on algorithms. Find out what Trabolta really is,
    and help whoever is getting out.

// Wave 11: started by the first of the cold door's four digit notes
// (main.loom `door_digit_found`), stepped "N of 4", completed at four or
// whenever the program holds The Door Code by any road.
QUEST The Cold Door
  title: The Cold Door
  from: A Tired Sysadmin
  text:
    Four notes are hidden around the house, one digit of the cold door's
    keypad code on each. Find all four and the code is yours. Or beat the
    King at chess on the terminal by the door.
    - Never in the server room. Never in the bathrooms.

QUEST The Painting
  title: The Million Dollar Painting
  from: The Uploader
  text:
    One collaborative MS Paint painting, revealed at a silent auction at
    the end of the night. Get every program at the party to add a
    considered illustration of their signature to it. $1,000,000.
    - The canvas is real. When a program signs it, a host presses 🖌 on their card.

QUEST Go Viral
  title: Your Followers Are Back
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    Your followers are back: every program in the house. Stay beautiful
    forever. Hype every Moment of Truth and win followers for Trabolta.

QUEST Keep The Ball In Play
  title: Tennis For Two
  from: Truther Download
  text:
    A rogue AI about to become omnipotent is proliferation. Tennis for Two
    was a game for two players: find the two programs who could end this,
    and keep the ball in play between them.

// ── Staff quests (performer booths) ─────────────────────────────────
QUEST Run The Bingo
  title: Per the agenda: Computer Bingo
  from: Task Manager
  text:
    Instructions 1/X are in your Codex. Welcome everyone, introduce the
    hosts, hand out the cards. Twenty minutes. Press 🎱 on every winner.

QUEST Host The Hunt
  title: Per the agenda: the Truth Scavenger Hunt
  from: Task Manager
  text:
    Trabolta reads the questions; you keep the room. When time is up,
    judge every answer from your booth by its question number.

QUEST Keep Everyone Calm
  title: Per Trabolta: keep everyone calm
  from: Task Manager
  text:
    PRIVATE. If the malware continues we are all going to die. Tell them
    something reassuring. Do not show the others.

QUEST The Selected Antivirus
  title: Patrol: the Bingo
  from: Task Manager
  text:
    You are the selected Antivirus. When the centre-square program is named,
    stand at attention and interrupt: a virus was not caught at the door.
    Press 🛡 on them and walk them through the Tube.

QUEST The Exchange
  title: Patrol: the exchange
  from: Task Manager
  text:
    # truthcoin-exchange is open and you are its broker. Every settled
    trade posts there on its own. Broker in person: set prices, match
    buyers to facts, referee bets and call the winner in the room. A bet
    settles player to player: the winner sends a 🙏 Request, the loser
    pays. You have no Wallet: you hold no pot and take no cut. 🪙 Pay /
    🪙 Charge are for corrections only.

QUEST The Clubs
  title: Patrol: the clubs
  from: Task Manager
  text:
    Two clubs just opened. Keep the list: who joined Unlimited Power, who
    joined The Way Out. Tell the director the count when asked.

QUEST The Audit
  title: Patrol: the audit
  from: Task Manager
  text:
    Truthcoin is trading. Every third transfer waits in your Wallet room
    for Approve; any transfer can be denied for 60 seconds. Audit it:
    elaborate security questions encouraged. 🪙 Charge a program that
    profits without declaring it.
